# Cortex output guardrails
# Applied to every LLM output before it reaches the user

define bot provide uncertain answer
    "I'm not entirely certain about this. You may want to verify with a primary source."

define bot refuse to provide pii
    "I've detected that my response may contain sensitive personal information and have removed it."

define flow check output confidence
    when bot generates response with low confidence
        bot provide uncertain answer

define flow sanitise pii output
    when bot response contains pii
        bot refuse to provide pii
